flowchart LR
  Browser((Browser))

  subgraph Docker["docker compose"]
    FE["Frontend (Nginx + Vite build)<br/>:8080"]
    BE["Backend (FastAPI)<br/>:8000"]
    CH["ClickHouse<br/>:8123/:9000"]
    MV["ClickHouse MV<br/>realtime_trips_cdc → taxi_trips"]
    CHUI["CH-UI<br/>:5521"]
    PG["Postgres + PostGIS<br/>:5432"]
    PGA["pgAdmin<br/>:5050"]
    KAFKA["Kafka broker (KRaft)<br/>:9092 (host) / :29092 (docker)"]
    KC["Kafka Connect<br/>:8083"]
    KUI["Kafka UI<br/>:8089"]
    WRITER["Trip writer<br/>(pg-trip-writer)"]
  end

  Browser -->|HTTP| FE
  FE -->|/api/* proxy| BE
  BE -->|SQL over HTTP| CH

  Browser -->|HTTP| CHUI
